---
/**
 * Dark-only: the brand palette is dark-native (the viewer declares
 * color-scheme: dark and ships no light ramp). Replaces Starlight's default
 * ThemeProvider, which reads a stored preference — here there is nothing to
 * read; the theme is forced before first paint.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
</script>
